### Ran Playwright code
```js
await page.evaluate('async () => { for (const n of [0,4,7]) document.querySelector(`.fret[data-note="${n}"]`).click(); document.querySelector("#next").click(); return {title:document.querySelector("#challengeName").textContent, target:document.querySelector("#targetNotes").textContent,level:document.querySelector("#levelBadge").textContent}; }');
```

